{
  "title": "Light Fluffy Tunisian Collards Dumplings",
  "description": "A sweet and fluffy Tunisian dish featuring collards, perfect for a crowd, and kosher-friendly. This dish is a unique blend of flavors and textures.",
  "cuisine": "Tunisian",
  "diet": [
    "kosher",
